1785611152699467	maw-dev	itc:v3:AWKTmSTM_JOSSTQAAAAAQa7Vbfq6qsAAAAEyyBU		item.comment	bn-3v9e	{"body":"Progress: implementation complete. Added explicit --accept-current; fail-closed atomic --keep preflight for dirty/diverged targets; validated header stripping with marker/path guards; path-limited auto-commits; per-path stale sidecar pruning and union conflict counts; aligned resolve/conflicts/merge reporting; removed resolver merge-readiness overclaims. New bn-3v9e integration suite covers dirty header-retained and header-free manual resolutions, marker/wrong-header refusal, orphan placeholder repair, unrelated staged changes, and partial metadata pruning. maw-cli unit suite plus conflict_state_truth, gate2_leftover_header, and new integration suite are green. Running just check next."}	blake3:Uy23-8q1kugWjGT40_85ogng21eGhYhLiezZunO58O8
